{
  "base_commit": "2cc6b176410426ce22a13c12ad415f657b03189e",
  "scope": "Eight stage rendering/loading methods: real scene/model/fog/animation access and evidence-based local names.",
  "changes": [
    "Top-level Render includes the genuine dScStage_c, frame-controller, shadow-model, collision, OAM and camera headers. Remove its local scene/class/vtable stand-ins. Use mTexAnimSlots, mSysTracker, mSkyboxModel and the named matrix translation/camera position fields.",
    "RenderModel and RenderModelTransparent use ModelComponents, BMD_Bone, BMD_Material and genuine virtual Model::Render. The active slot material filtering and volatile flag read remain in ROM order.",
    "LoadModel and LoadSkybox call Model::LoadAndSetFile. LoadModel walks the real material array and writes existing flags by name.",
    "LoadTextureTransformers uses StageTexAnimSlot and modelFile, and calls TextureTransformer::Prepare. RenderModel calls TextureTransformer::Update. Keep the exact unsigned-int allocation/C1 and scalar Fix12 SetFile interfaces.",
    "RenderFog selects the existing Fog records and reads their named fields. G3X::SetFogTable uses its header declaration. LoadFog names the normal/underwater density ramps and level records, correcting the old contradictory slope description.",
    "Name material/slot/player indices, position XOR, player flag bits and coin-counter Y coordinate. Declare data0209f340 as char* in the two renderer callers, using explicit local partial record views; no global semantic rename or new shared layout claim."
  ],
  "evidence": {
    "layouts": "Existing dScStage_c header owns mSysTracker+0x50, mModel+0x86c, mTexAnimSlots+0x8bc, mFog+0x96c and mSkyboxModel+0x9bc. Model::data is+8 and its matrix+0x1c. ModelComponents and BMD_File own the material/bone arrays. BMD_Material flags are+0x24 in a0x30 record. Model header documents Render in vtable slot5. Camera position is+0x8c; Matrix4x3 translation is+0x24.",
    "fog_selection": "RenderFog uses mFog[1] when IsUnderwater returns true, otherwise mFog[0], unless the existing level5 override returns a nonnull Fog. LoadFog starts the first ramp at0 with step4 and the underwater ramp at0x28 with step2; normal fog starts disabled.",
    "position_xor": "The player pointer array is data0209f394; dActor_c declares the three position components starting+0x5c. Render XORs their low bytes and separately packs bit0 of each player byte+0x6ff. The latter field meaning remains unnamed.",
