    "probes": [
      "Ordinary new TextureTransformer reproduced the instructions but changed the allocator relocation from _Znwj to _Znwm. Keep the explicit _Znwj and null-guarded C1 sequence.",
      "G3X::SetFog with the existing u8 mEnabled inserts cmp/movne/moveq boolean normalization absent in the ROM; retain the documented raw scalar call. Disassembly saved in build/scene-physics32-fog-probe.json.",
      "Addressing only the skybox translation vector changed ADD/STR offsets. Taking the genuine Matrix4x3 pointer and accessing transform->t.x/y/z reproduces every original instruction.",
      "Renaming a local global-pointer type exposed a declaration-baseline disagreement. The final char* declarations plus explicit local views agree with the existing population and remain byte-identical."
    ],
    "retained_constraints": [
      "BMD_Bone count+0x30 remains an explicit raw halfword read within its opaque padding. Level records remain local partial views. Shared headers are unchanged.",
      "Preserve volatile material flag test, per-slot count reloads, bone/slot stepping, virtual calls through Model pointers, skybox pointer reread, render order, player raw fields/alias shape and scalar Fix12 ABI.",
      "Keep exact public names, helper/global symbols, file paths, configuration, production ownership and allocator/destructor dispatch. No new original TU or full-class reconstruction claim."
    ],
    "runtime_validation": "No new emulator claim. Changes use existing layouts, direct field consumers and byte/relocation proof. No speculative game-state meaning added."
